{"repositoryId":1422907434,"availability":"available","full":"Daevsoft/smart-financial","name":"smart-financial","description":"Personal Financial Application - Offline App","category":"Finance","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-17T03:30:32Z","updated":"2026-10-19T06:40:32Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://smart-financial-two.vercel.app","topics":["compose-ui","finance-application","finance-tracker","framework","javascript","reactive"],"demo":"https://smart-financial-two.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T07:22:00.163Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T07:22:00.163Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T07:22:00.163Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T07:22:00.163Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Offline personal finance tracker — a single-page app built with the Jetz framework.","Your data never leaves the browser. No account, no backend, no network calls.","Most budgeting tools are either spreadsheets or cloud accounts. FinTrack aims for the middle: a real app — dashboards, charts, budgets, filters — that is entirely local. Everything lives in localStorage, exports to a plain JSON file or an Excel-friendly CSV, and reimports from the JSON snapshot."],"features":["Five stat cards — balance, income, expenses, savings rate, and Total saved (money parked in","deposit accounts, with a \"Saved today / this month\" sub-line) — each of the first four with a month-over-month delta chip.","Cash-flow trend (Chart.js line + area) with a range switch: 1D / 1M / 3M / 6M / 1Y.","Monthly net stock-style chart: income − expenses over the last 12 calendar months, with a","gradient area fill, a dashed zero baseline, and a MoM percentage chip."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Daevsoft/smart-financial/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"751c2a07ce6ba93a8c5b389f3962c36a698031bdc70b995f865cd1b0a19c39b6","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T07:22:00.257Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"20